@startuml US204-SSD
autonumber
title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US204: Top 5 Most Utilized Aircraft Models

actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO

System -> BO: Authentication successful
BO -> System: Requests the Top 5 most utilized aircraft models (by flight hours or assignments)
activate System
System --> BO: Returns the Top 5 most utilized aircraft models
deactivate System

@enduml
